RustPythonJavaScriptC#KotlinJavaC <p>Import <code>Validator</code> and the report types from <code>fatoora_core::invoice::validation</code>. <code>Validator::new()</code> (or <code>Validator::default()</code>) needs no configuration: the schemas and rule set are embedded and do not depend on the ZATCA environment. It is <code>Copy</code> and reusable.</p> <p>Schema validation</p> <pre><code>validator.validate_xml(xml: &amp;str)
